Hey {{artist_name}},

Here's one of the bits of Fully Open we think is seriously cool. You don't have to wait until a song is finished before it belongs here.

Track Version Control lets you capture the whole thing — first idea, phone recording, rehearsal, demo, mixes and eventually the master. Put today's version in, add the next one when it changes, and keep the creative history of a song.

Start with what you're making now: {{versions_url}}

